---

This mod ships no Valheim assets. Fonts, sprites and item icons are read from
the running game at load time and are not redistributed. Valheim is the
property of Iron Gate Studio; this project is not affiliated with or endorsed
by Iron Gate Studio or Coffee Stain Publishing.

Provisioner is a fork of ForgePlanner by Biozip
(https://github.com/Biozip/ForgePlanner). It keeps ForgePlanner's licence and
copyright notice above.

The images bundled with this mod are the five in `art/`: a direction arrow
drawn by Biozip for ForgePlanner, and a pin, a refresh arrow, a gear and a bin
drawn for Provisioner. The package icon, `provisioner/icon.png`, was drawn for
Provisioner. No game art and no other site's marks are included.
